  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Gender Equality through the Implementation of the Gender  Equality Seal in Municipality of Ulaanbaatar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender-responsive public institutions are increasingly critical. Evidence shows that inclusive institutions are more responsive, accountable, and effective. Embedding gender considerations across all functions&#xad;from policy design to service delivery-is key to building public trust and ensuring inclusive development. Mongolia has established a strong legal and policy framework for gender equality through the Law on Promotion of Gender Equality {2011} and the Cross-Sectoral Strategic Plan 2022-2031</narrative>
  </description>
